      {
        "text": "Webkul QloApps contains a remote code execution and SQL injection vulnerabilities. A remote attacker with administrative privileges could upload executable files and achieve remote code execution or send a crafted SQL query that bypasses validation.",
        "title": "Risk Evaluation",
        "category": "summary"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fixed in 153ec1c and 123c97c.",
        "title": "Recommended Practices",
        "category": "general"
      },
      {
        "text": "India",
        "title": "Company Headquarters Location",
        "category": "other"
